Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: "No module named 'yaml'"

Solution: Run pip3 install pyyaml
Issue: Processor doesn't detect new events

Solution: Ensure log file exists and has proper permissions
Issue: No alerts generated

Solution: Check that event patterns match rules in security_rules.yaml
Issue: Permission denied errors

Solution: Ensure scripts are executable: chmod +x *.py
